WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.024
Measure angles with a protractor: acute less than 90 degrees , right equals 90

00:00:06.024 --> 00:00:12.264
degrees , obtuse between 90 degrees and 180 degrees , reflex greater than 180 degrees

00:00:12.264 --> 00:00:12.680
.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:21.176
Classify an angle of 270 degrees . The answer is reflex. 270 degrees is reflex: acute

00:00:21.176 --> 00:00:28.341
less than 90 degrees , right equals 90 degrees , obtuse 90–180 degrees , straight

00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:33.117
equals 180 degrees , reflex greater than 180 degrees .

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.163
A protractor reading in the class garden shows 180 degrees . What type of angle is

00:00:39.163 --> 00:00:41.118
it? Pause the video and think.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:48.562
A protractor reading in the class garden shows 180 degrees . What type of angle is

00:00:48.562 --> 00:00:54.762
it? The answer is straight. 180 degrees is straight: acute less than 90 degrees ,

00:00:54.762 --> 00:01:00.548
right equals 90 degrees , obtuse 90–180 degrees , straight equals 180 degrees ,

00:01:00.548 --> 00:01:03.027
reflex greater than 180 degrees .
